&=kQ\cdot4La\cdot\frac{1}{\left[L^{2}\left(1-\frac{a^{2}}{L^{2}}\right)\right]^{2}}=\frac{4kQa}{L^{3}}\\
\therefore\ \frac{E_{M}}{E_{N}}&=\frac{1}{2}
